          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
        <div id="skill-database" class="skill-card">
          <h3>Database Testing</h3>
          <p>
            SQL, PostgreSQL, SQLite, and MySQL for backend and data validation.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
        <div id="skill-performance" class="skill-card">
          <h3>Performance Testing</h3>
          <p>
            JMeter, smoke, baseline, load, and stress testing.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
        <div id="skill-cicd" class="skill-card">
          <h3>CI/CD & Version Control</h3>
          <p>Azure DevOps, Git, GitHub, Bitbucket, and SourceTree.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Testing methods and areas of experience (Testing Expertise) -->
    <div class="mt-5 text-center">
      <h3 class="mb-4">Testing Expertise</h3>

      <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center gap-2">
        <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light p-3"> Functional </span>

        <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light p-3"> Regression </span>

        <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light p-3"> Integration </span>

        <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light p-3"> End-to-End </span>

        <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light p-3"> Exploratory </span>

        <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light p-3"> API </span>

        <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light p-3"> Performance </span>

        <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light p-3">
          Accessibility
        </span>

        <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light p-3">
          Backend Validation
        </span>

        <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light p-3">
          Database Validation
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Professional capabilities that support effective QA work (Professional Strengths) -->
    <div class="mt-4 text-center">
      <h3 class="mb-4">Professional Strengths</h3>

      <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center gap-2">
        <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light p-3">
          Analytical Thinking
        </span>

        <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light p-3">
          Attention to Detail
        </span>

        <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light p-3">
          Problem Solving
        </span>

        <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light p-3">
          Cross-Functional Collaboration
        </span>

        <span class="badge rounded-pill text-bg-light p-3">
          Clear Documentation
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ==================== FEATURED PROJECT SECTION ==================== -->
<!-- Overview of the full-stack application and its testing layers (Featured Project) -->
<section id="project" class="project-section section-padding">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row align-items-center g-5">

      <!-- Project purpose and application structure (Project Overview) -->
      <div class="col-lg-7">
        <p class="section-label text-info">FEATURED PROJECT</p>

        <h2 class="display-6 fw-bold mb-4">Full-Stack QA Automation Project</h2>

        <p class="lead">
          Web Application · Unit Testing · UI Automation · API Testing · Database Validation
        </p>

        <p class="project-description">
          A full-stack web application built as an Application Under Test (AUT)
          to demonstrate end-to-end quality engineering across the UI, API,
          backend, and database layers.
        </p>

        <!-- Show how data moves through the application (Application Flow) -->
        <div class="mt-4">
          <p class="mb-3 text-info fw-semibold">Application Flow</p>

          <div class="application-flow">
            <div class="flow-step">Web UI</div>

            <div class="flow-arrow">→</div>

            <div class="flow-step">Node.js / Express</div>

            <div class="flow-arrow">→</div>

            <div class="flow-step">PostgreSQL</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-5">
          <a
            id="project-details-button"
            href="/project"
            class="btn btn-info btn-lg"
          >
            View Project Details
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testing areas covered by the project (Testing Layers) -->
      <div class="col-lg-5">
        <div class="project-summary-card">
          <h3 class="mb-4">Testing Layers</h3>

          <ul class="project-list">
            <li>Unit Testing</li>

            <li>UI Testing</li>

            <li>API Testing</li>

            <li>Backend Validation</li>

            <li>Database Validation</li>

            <li>Performance Testing</li>

            <li>Accessibility Testing</li>

            <li>Cross-Browser Testing</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ==================== CONTACT SECTION ==================== -->
<!-- Contact form for sending messages to the backend (Contact Form) -->
<section id="contact" class="section-padding">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
      <div class="col-lg-7">
        <div class="text-center mb-4">
          <p class="section-label">CONTACT</p>

          <h2 class="section-title mb-3">Let's Connect</h2>

          <p class="contact-text">Send me a message using the form below.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Display a confirmation after a successful submission (Success Message) -->
        <div
          id="success-message"
          class="alert alert-success d-none"
          role="alert"
        >
          Message sent successfully!
        </div>

        <!-- Send the entered contact information to the backend (POST Form) -->
        <form id="contact-form" action="/contact" method="post">
          <div class="mb-3">
            <label for="name" class="form-label"> Name </label>

            <input
              type="text"
              class="form-control"
              id="name"
              name="name"
              required
            />
          </div>

          <div class="mb-3">
            <label for="email" class="form-label"> Email </label>

            <input
              type="email"
              class="form-control"
              id="email"
              name="email"
              required
            />
          </div>

          <div class="mb-3">
            <label for="message" class="form-label"> Message </label>

            <textarea
              class="form-control"
              id="message"
              name="message"
              rows="5"
              required
            ></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center">
            <button
              id="send-message-button"
              type="submit"
              class="btn btn-primary btn-lg"
            >
              Send Message
            </button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer.ejs'); -%>
